(6972866, 1051535, 62318, '<td valign="top">Everything is good here except that poll on his right arm, actually I would have liked to see more of that arm. It knocked you down from an 8 to a 7. But this is a tremendous shot.</td>', 'Everything is good here except that poll on his right arm, actually I would have liked to see more of that arm. It knocked you down from an 8 to a 7. But this is a tremendous shot.', '2013-02-05 23:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972869, 1051428, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like hydrangeas. I enjoy detail and the color blue is so soothing. <br/>Blue hydrangeas are better than the pink ones anyways, but I like that you still have some color on this one in winter (must live southish). Good job. Gave you a 7, likely higher if the blob on the bottom left were removed.</td>', 'I like hydrangeas. I enjoy detail and the color blue is so soothing. Blue hydrangeas are better than the pink ones anyways, but I like that you still have some color on this one in winter (must live southish). Good job. Gave you a 7, likely higher if the blob on the bottom left were removed.', '2013-02-05 23:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
