(6972877, 1051345, 152252, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite. Very clever. Like the tree repetition. Gave it a 10 before</td>', 'One of my favorite. Very clever. Like the tree repetition. Gave it a 10 before', '2013-02-05 23:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972878, 1050667, 62318, '<td valign="top">Such a good abstract. So good. <br/>The descending black square/circle/head.<br/>The play of light and dark<br/>The bucket.<br/>The hard cut of light.<br/>It is really a piece which keeps you there. <br/> <br/>But I''m torn with the grain...it''s harder to justify these days; I would be curious to see what it would looked like with reduced sharpness/clarity so you get the same effect just without the noise.<br/> <br/>I''m still giving you an 8.</td>', 'Such a good abstract. So good. The descending black square/circle/head.The play of light and darkThe bucket.The hard cut of light.It is really a piece which keeps you there.  But I''m torn with the grain...it''s harder to justify these days; I would be curious to see what it would looked like with reduced sharpness/clarity so you get the same effect just without the noise. I''m still giving you an 8.', '2013-02-05 23:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
