(6972882, 1051636, 62318, '<td valign="top">Good light, scary trees, it all adds up to a good score. I know hickory, but I''ll take you word on the hornbeam. Cheers.</td>', 'Good light, scary trees, it all adds up to a good score. I know hickory, but I''ll take you word on the hornbeam. Cheers.', '2013-02-05 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
