(6972908, 1051336, 112736, '<td valign="top">Slightly disappointed in the results, but I should have known better:  Intentional headroom was a bad idea (I should have shallowed the d.o.f., that was my bad) and the desat look never really goes over well either.  Not to mention kid photos are always voted low.<br/> <br/>Till next time!</td>', 'Slightly disappointed in the results, but I should have known better:  Intentional headroom was a bad idea (I should have shallowed the d.o.f., that was my bad) and the desat look never really goes over well either.  Not to mention kid photos are always voted low. Till next time!', '2013-02-06 00:07:15.000000', NULL, 0),
