(6972943, 1051414, 50641, '<td valign="top">What cuties... they look a lot like one of ours... (Sophie <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1050854" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1050854.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1050854.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1050854.jpg"/></a>) - what kind of mix are they?  OOh ok, petite basset griffon vendeen... found them in your port.  They''re a bit bigger than Sophie I think.  Beautiful pooches.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-06 00:47:43.</i></td>', 'What cuties... they look a lot like one of ours... (Sophie ) - what kind of mix are they?  OOh ok, petite basset griffon vendeen... found them in your port.  They''re a bit bigger than Sophie I think.  Beautiful pooches.', '2013-02-06 00:41:16.000000', '2013-02-06 00:47:43.000000', 0),
